# 情境 05：V2 的已知限制——整套回滾（rollback）無法偵測（報告 Q5）
reset all
login v2 pw-v2
upload contract.txt price = 100
server snapshot before
expect ok
upload invoice.txt pay 5000 by Friday
ls
expect contains invoice.txt

# 伺服器把 files/ 與 meta/ 整份換回快照：舊清單的 HMAC 仍然是使用者自己算的、有效的
attack rollback before
expect ok
ls
expect ok
expect contains contract.txt
expect not-contains invoice.txt
cat contract.txt
expect ok
expect contains price = 100
